OL,3,GNEWSAIsland's general election
OL,4,Acandidates confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA final list of candidates has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed for Sark's upcoming general
OL,8,Felection.
OL,10,FFour women and 12 men are on the ballot
OL,11,Ffor the 25 November vote - a minimum of
OL,12,F11 candidates is needed for a contested
OL,13,Felection.
OL,15,FNine seats are available for a
OL,16,Ffour-year term and one seat for a
OL,17,Ftwo-year term, after one conseiller was
OL,18,Fdeselected due to non-attendance at
OL,19,Fthree consecutive statutory meetings of
OL,20,Fthe Sark government earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
