OL,3,GNEWSAIsland's general election
OL,4,Acandidates confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Chief Pleas spokesperson said "a
OL,7,Fstrong field of candidates helps ensure
OL,8,Fthat voters have a genuine choice,
OL,9,Fencourages debate about Sark's future,
OL,10,Fand ensures that the election will be
OL,11,Fcontested". A polling station in Island
OL,12,FHall will be open from 08:00 GMT to
OL,13,F18:00.
